  <description><![CDATA[海洋自由谈（Inspiring Ocean）是一档探讨海洋保护议题的对话节目。我们会不定期邀请国内外海洋保护领域或相关行业的嘉宾做客对话间，与我们自由谈论关于海洋保护的那些事儿。期待我们的对话所碰撞出的火花能够为这个领域内的探索者和关注海洋保护话题的伙伴带来有价值的思考和启发。
Inspiring Ocean is a conversational podcast that explores issues related to marine conservation. We hope that the sparks from our dialogues will provide valuable insights and inspiration to practitioners in this field and to those who care about marine conservation and our blue ocean.]]></description>
